art-label\" style=\"--len:12;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">복제용이성(매체독립성)</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:1.33%; top:31.90%; width:28.31%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:1.33%; top:2.00%; width:9.91%; height:14.86%; border-radius:50%; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:2.00%; width:28.31%; height:29.90%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-bright), var(--sea-mid));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:29;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">자료가 너무 많아 사건과 관련된 증거를 찾기가 어려움</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:31.90%; width:19.93%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-sky), var(--sea-bright));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:3;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">대량성</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:31.90%; width:28.31%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:2.00%; width:9.91%; height:14.86%; border-radius:50%; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:2.00%; width:28.31%; height:29.90%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-sky), var(--sea-bright));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:26;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">특정 시스템 또는 장비 없이 내용을 볼 수 없음</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:31.90%; width:19.93%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ink-white), var(--sea-bright));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:4;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">비가시성</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:31.90%; width:28.31%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:2.00%; width:9.91%; height:14.86%; border-radius:50%; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:1.33%; top:52.00%; width:28.31%; height:29.90%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ink-white), var(--sea-bright));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:34;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">위,변조 되었을 때 이를 입증하거나 원 내용을 추적하기 어려움</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:1.33%; top:81.90%; width:19.93%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-bright), var(--sea-deep));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:11;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">변조 용이성(취악성)</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:1.33%; top:81.90%; width:28.31%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:1.33%; top:52.00%; width:9.91%; height:14.86%; border-radius:50%; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:52.00%; width:28.31%; height:29.90%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-bright), var(--sea-deep));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:34;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">압수장소, 관할이 얽히거나 미래에 해당 정보를 확인하기 어려움</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:81.90%; width:19.93%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-foam), var(--sea-bright));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:14;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">네트워크 관련성(초국경성)</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:81.90%; width:28.31%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:34.67%; top:52.00%; width:9.91%; height:14.86%; border-radius:50%; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:52.00%; width:28.31%; height:29.90%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-foam), var(--sea-bright));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:29;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">정보보안 향상 등 증거 획득이 시간이 갈수록 어려워짐</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:81.90%; width:19.93%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sea-bright), var(--sea-mid));\"><span class=\"smartart-label\" style=\"--len:8;\"><div class=\"sa-main\">복잡성(전문성)</div></span></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:81.90%; width:28.31%; height:12.86%; border-radius:10px; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n  <div class=\"smartart-node is-decor\" data-lvl=\"0\" style=\"left:68.00%; top:52.00%; width:9.91%; height:14.86%; border-radius:50%; background:var(--sea-sky);\"></div>\n</div>",
